ewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"180"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hyumu Hellsing is a butler of the Kuki Family."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is ranked #0 amongst the butlers and maids of the Kuki Group since the power gap between him and the #2 is just way too great."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"He is the personal butler of the Kuki Mikado and his wife Tsubone. Hyumu is also entrusted with the protection of the children of the Kuki Mikado and Tsubone - Ageha, Hideo and Monshiro - after Monshiro, the weakest of the three when it comes to physical prowess, transferred to Kawakami Academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hyumu was trained in all kinds of martial arts and he mastered all the skills that focused on kicking. He joined the Kuki group to complete his skill-set by mastering the \"Kuki Fighting Art\"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"The other servants call him Mr. Hyumu."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Edited from Majikoi Wiki"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c5872"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/9b/9b9d5c3875838beda87e87ea76414480a0acba8da6dce406e2c4a4800860cec8.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4a/4a9a259c38339e2adea5a44a1deaa5a53a734626c78290cfb71cd5cb31e4fdd3.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"黒田 崇矢","creatorId":"vndb:s170","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s170","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s170","name":"黒田 崇矢","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:53734","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c9794","characterName":"井上 準","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c9794"},"originalCharacterName":"井上 準","characterNameSource":null,"rol